<p>Using small steam motors to enhance your movements, you are able to slip past up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> foes in a line.</p><p>After passing the targets, you will quickly run <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 5</acronym> tiles away.</p>